{{!-- The silent switch of a device, beside its wireless one (couronne du PAN, lot 6, SR5 p. 236). Takes deviceMode
(the item's entry of deviceModes) and itemId. Nothing while the device is out of the Matrix, nor for a deployed drone,
which holds its own switches on its sheet. The slot itself is always there: it is the silent column of the list. --}}
<span class="sr-silent-slot">{{#if deviceMode}}{{#unless (or (eq deviceMode.mode "offline") deviceMode.locked)}}
{{#if (eq deviceMode.silentFrom "self")}}
<a class="device-silent-toggle" data-item-id="{{itemId}}" data-mode="active" data-tooltip="{{localize 'SR5.DeviceModeLeaveSilent'}}"><em class="fas fa-sm fa-user-secret SR-SubColor"></em></a>
{{else if (eq deviceMode.silentFrom "master")}}
<a class="device-silent-toggle" data-item-id="{{itemId}}" data-mode="silent" data-tooltip="{{localize 'SR5.DeviceModeSilentFromMaster'}}"><em class="fas fa-sm fa-user-secret SR-LightGreyColor"></em></a>
{{else}}
<a class="device-silent-toggle" data-item-id="{{itemId}}" data-mode="silent" data-tooltip="{{localize 'SR5.PanMenuModeSilent'}}"><em class="fas fa-sm fa-user-secret"></em></a>
{{/if}}
{{/unless}}{{/if}}</span>
